(5  Discussion) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 754.49 Tm
(Splitting the surface has a cost: the renderer must be explicit about what it does not) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 741.09 Tm
(know. In practice this is a feature. Every capability the UI lacks is a capability the) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 727.69 Tm
(sidecar can add without a frontend release, and every assumption the UI makes is a single) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 714.29 Tm
(translation away from being wrong in exactly one place.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 694.89 Tm
(The remaining risk is drift between the protocol and its documentation. We mitigate it by) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 681.49 Tm
(treating unknown frames as errors rather than no-ops, and by pinning the frame enum in a) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 668.09 Tm
(single crate shared by both sides.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 642.09 Tm
(6  Conclusion) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 652.69 Tm
(A workspace that scales with the number of files, not the number of rendered rows, is) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 639.29 Tm
(straightforward once the tree is treated as derived state. The protocol that carries an) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 72.00 625.89 Tm
(agent session through that workspace is the part worth getting right.) Tj
